Project Planning PhaseProject Planning Phase – PocketSmart AI: Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

The Project Planning Phase is used to define the project goals, activities, resources, schedule, and expected outcomes before development begins.

1. Project Goal

To develop an intelligent budget assistant that helps users track expenses, manage budgets, monitor savings, and receive personalized financial recommendations.

2. Project Objectives

Track daily income and expenses.

Categorize expenses automatically.

Set monthly budgets.

Monitor spending and savings.

Analyze spending patterns.

Provide smart recommendations.

Generate financial reports and charts.


